{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04774","headline":"送赵顺直郎中赴安西副大都督 · 张说","name":"送赵顺直郎中赴安西副大都督","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"绝镇功难立，悬军命匪轻。\n复承迁相後，弥重任贤情。\n将起神仙地，才称礼乐英。\n长心堪系虏，短语足论兵。\n日授休门法，星教置阵名。\n龙泉恩已着，燕颔相终成。\n月窟穷天远，河源入塞清。\n老天操别翰，承旨颂升平。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张说","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04774.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04774","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}